OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear
OL,6,Fperiods and the odd showers this
OL,7,Fevening. Then the rest of the night
OL,8,Fwill be mainly dry with clear periods
OL,9,Fbut one or two showers across western
OL,10,FTayside.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA mostly dry day with some
OL,13,Fgood spells of sunshine. A few showers
OL,14,Facross western Tayside at first.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FWindy
OL,17,Fwith patchy rain spreading north later
OL,18,Fon Tuesday. Early rain on Wednesday
OL,19,Fthen bright with the odd shower.
OL,20,FMainly dry and bright on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
